Blended Cost Reduction by Routing Pattern 
    - non-LLM Alternative 
        - deterministic code, rules, lookups
    - small model offload
        - classification, extraction , formatting
    - tiered / cascading 
        - try small model first, escalate when confidence is low
    - model pooling by task family
        - reasoning / summarisation  / extraction / embeddings

bloated agent:
every tool schema / full history  / top-20 chunks / task

lean agent:
active skill  / Summary  / top-3 chunks / task



Single-Skill Single-Responsiblity Design
3-5x faster task completion

1.  each agent should have exactly one specified skill 
     one clear domain of responsiblity 


2. skills as pure deterministic function

3. Tool-first design over agent-first
    start by defining skill s and tools your system needs

Skill engineering best practcies
 - scope narrowly 
    - one workflow per skill, small skills compose
 - name for discovery 
    - clear names and descriptions
 - prefer scripts to prose
    - deterministic steps as code
 - reuse and chain
    - compose skills into larger automations instead of duplicationing
 - version and evaluate
    - treat skills as software

Prompt Engineering Best Practices 


Prompt Anatomy for Cache Efficiency 

static zone:  maximize KV cache hit rate

KV Cache Prefix Boundary

dynamic zone:  always append here 
- user message
- retrieved chunks / current cntext
- turn history (summarized, not replayed)


